# Screenshots are release assets: `screenshots.json` lists them, both READMEs
# embed them, and the plugin-market entry cannot render a card without them.
# `lib/` above is deliberately ignored (build output), so these need no
# un-ignore rule today — they are here to defend against a future broad rule
# being added to this file that would silently swallow the marketplace images.
!docs/assets/
!docs/assets/*.png